WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.690
Galilee, around the year 30.

2
00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.760
A teacher from Nazareth is drawing crowds.

3
00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:10.560
Pharisees invite him to dinner, then
complain that he eats with sinners.

4
00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.330
In Jerusalem, he drives the
traders out of the Temple.

5
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:18.860
And in the end, he dies by
crucifixion, a Roman punishment.

6
00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:22.030
So why did this teacher keep
clashing with Pharisees,

7
00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.050
priests and Romans?

8
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.390
In this mission, you'll
explore a divided land:

9
00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.070
client kings, Roman
prefects and Greek cities.

10
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.600
Then you'll compare the groups of his day,

11
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:36.130
from Pharisees to Sadducees.

12
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:40.410
Your mission: find out why this
teacher kept clashing with Pharisees,

13
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.030
priests and Romans.
